msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:277
msgid "Rotation Interval"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:278
msgid ""
"Controls how long each tab stays active, in milliseconds. If the tab "
"contents differ a lot in height, set a \"Content Height\" on the design tab "
"to stop the page from jumping on each switch."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:295
#: builder/inc/helpers/class-fusion-builder-background-slider-helper.php:143
msgid "Pause On Hover"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:296
msgid ""
"Choose to pause the rotation while the mouse is over the element. Rotation "
"always pauses while a tab has keyboard focus."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:313
msgid "Resume After Interaction"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:314
msgid ""
"Choose whether rotation continues after a visitor selects a tab themselves. "
"When set to no, rotation stops for good on the first interaction."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:331
msgid "Play / Pause Button"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:332
msgid ""
"Show a play / pause button above the tabs, so visitors can stop the "
"rotation. Recommended as accessibility aid."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:352
msgid ""
"Global setting for all tabs, this can be overridden individually. Click an "
"icon to select, click again to deselect."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:356
msgid ""
"Choose the position of the icon on the tab. Icons can be selected in the "
"general tab for the same icon on all tabs, or in each child item for "
"individual tab icons."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:369
msgid ""
"Set the size of the icon. In pixels, ex: 13px. Icons can be selected in the "
"general tab for the same icon on all tabs, or in each child item for "
"individual tab icons."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:417
msgid "Tabs Title Tag"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:418
msgid "Choose HTML tag of the tabs title, either div or the heading tag, h1-h6."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:436
msgid "Tabs Title Typography"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:437
msgid "Controls the tabs title text typography."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:459
msgid "Controls the color of the tabs title."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:492
msgid ""
"Controls the padding of tabs title, In pixels or percentage, ex: 10px or "
"10%."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:508
msgid "Tabs Title Border Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:509
msgid ""
"Controls the thickness of the border around each tab. In pixels or em, ex: "
"1px. Leave empty for the default of 1px, or set 0 to remove a side."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:530
msgid ""
"Controls the border radius of tabs title, In pixels or percentage, ex: 10px "
"or 10%. The content panel keeps its own border, which can sit oddly against "
"rounded tabs; set Border Color to transparent to drop it."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:542
msgid "Tabs Title Background Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:543
msgid "Controls the background inactive tab color. "
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:559
msgid "Tabs Background Gradient"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:560
msgid ""
"Set to \"Yes\" to fill the tabs with a gradient. It is painted over the "
"background color above, so a gradient using transparency blends into that "
"color."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:571
msgid "Tabs Gradient Start Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:572
msgid ""
"Select start color for the tab gradient. Leave the active state empty to "
"use the same gradient on every tab."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:594
msgid "Tabs Gradient End Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:595
msgid ""
"Select end color for the tab gradient. Leave the active state empty to use "
"the same gradient on every tab."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:617
msgid "Tabs Gradient Start Position"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:618
msgid "Select start position for the tab gradient."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:634
msgid "Tabs Gradient End Position"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:635
msgid "Select end position for the tab gradient."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:651
msgid "Tabs Gradient Type"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:652
msgid "Controls the tab gradient type."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:670
msgid "Tabs Radial Direction"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:671
msgid "Select direction for the radial tab gradient."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:701
msgid "Tabs Gradient Angle"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:702
msgid "Controls the tab gradient angle. In degrees."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:725
msgid "Tab Description Font Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:726
msgid ""
"Set the font size of the tab descriptions. Enter value with unit, ex: 14px. "
"Leave empty to use a size relative to the tab title."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:733
msgid "Tab Description Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:734
msgid ""
"Controls the color of the tab descriptions. Leave empty to use the active "
"tab title color."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:742
msgid "Content Height"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:743
msgid ""
"Set a fixed height for the tab content area. When the content exceeds this "
"height, a scrollbar will appear. Leave empty to disable. Enter value with "
"unit, ex: 400px."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:755
msgid ""
"Controls the padding of tabs content, In pixels or percentage, ex: 10px or "
"10%."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:771
msgid ""
"Controls the thickness of the border around the tab list and the content "
"panel, in pixels. The two are one continuous frame on this design, so a "
"single size keeps them aligned. Set to 0 to remove the border."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:790
msgid "Content Border Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:791
msgid ""
"Controls the thickness of the border around the content panel. In pixels or "
"em, ex: 1px. This design draws no panel border by default, so anything "
"above 0 adds one. Pairs with the content background color and border radius."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:811
msgid "Content Border Radius"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:812
msgid ""
"Controls the border radius of the content panel, in pixels or percentage, "
"ex: 10px or 10%. On the classic design the active tab runs into the top "
"edge of the panel, so rounding only the bottom corners usually reads best "
"there."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:825
msgid ""
"Controls the background color of the content panel. Leave empty for the "
"default, which is the active tab background color on the classic design, so "
"that panel and active tab read as one surface, and no color at all on the "
"clean design."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:834
msgid ""
"Controls the color of the border around the tab list and the content panel. "
"Set it to transparent to remove those borders, which is often what rounded "
"tabs want."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:842
msgid "Active Tab Accent Border Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:843
msgid ""
"Controls the color of the accent edge on the active tab, which only the "
"classic design draws. The rotation progress indicator falls back to it when "
"no color of its own is set."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:851
msgid "Active Tab Accent Border Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:852
msgid ""
"Controls the thickness of the accent border on the active tab, in pixels. "
"When auto rotation is enabled, the progress line is drawn along that same "
"border."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:870
msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:871
msgid ""
"Show a progress indicator on the active tab that fills up before the next "
"tab is shown. The classic design uses a bar on the active tab accent edge, "
"the clean design fills the tab itself."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:889
msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator Style"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:890
msgid ""
"Choose whether the progress fills the background of the active tab, or "
"draws a line along its edge. Default uses a line on the classic design, "
"drawn over the accent edge it already has, and a background fill on the "
"clean design."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:914
msgid "Rotation Progress Line Position"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:915
msgid ""
"Choose which edge of the active tab the progress line runs along. Any edge "
"can be used on either tab layout. Default uses the start edge for vertical "
"tabs and the bottom edge for horizontal ones."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:920
msgid "Horizontal - Top"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:921
msgid "Horizontal - Bottom"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:922
msgid "Vertical - Start"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:923
msgid "Vertical - End"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:952
msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:953
msgid ""
"Set the color of the rotation progress indicator. Leave empty to derive it "
"from the active tab border color, softened so the progress stays readable "
"against it."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:973
msgid "Rotation Progress Track Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:974
msgid ""
"Set the color of the unfilled part of the progress line. Leave empty to use "
"the border color."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1004
msgid "Rotation Progress Indicator Size"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1005
msgid ""
"Set the thickness of the rotation progress line, in pixels. The classic "
"design draws it along the active tab accent border, so it follows \"Active "
"Border Size\" there."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1040
msgid "Play / Pause Button Color"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1041
msgid ""
"Set the text and icon color of the play / pause button. Leave empty to use "
"the tab title color, switching to the active tab title color on hover."
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1062
msgid "Mobile Mode"
msgstr ""

#: builder/elements/tabs/Params.php:1064
