#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:83
msgid "Paste your script here including the <script> tags."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:94
msgid "Consent Category"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:95
msgid ""
"Assign this snippet to a consent category. \"Necessary\" snippets always "
"load and show as a locked checkbox. Other categories require consent and "
"appear as a checkbox in the matching Consent Category content. Choose \"Do "
"Not Add To A Group\" to load the snippet without listing it — useful for "
"consent-aware scripts that handle consent signals themselves."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:102
msgid "Placement"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:103
msgid "Where should this snippet be output in the page."
