msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:108
msgid "After <body>"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:109
msgid "Before </body>"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:114
msgid "Cookie Lifespan"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:115
msgid ""
"Optional. Describe how long the cookies set by this service persist (e.g. "
"\"1 year\", \"Session\", \"180 days\"). Shown next to the consent checkbox "
"in the Consent Category content."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:121
msgid "Data Type"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:122
msgid ""
"Optional. Declares what this snippet does with visitor data, so the "
"matching icon and badge can be shown next to it in the Privacy & Consent "
"Bar and Element. Leave unset if you are not sure — nothing is shown rather "
"than an incorrect claim. Icons and badges are configured under Privacy & "
"Consent > Data Collection."
