"Use it to explain what this snippet does (e.g. \"Used to track conversions "
"and show personalised ads.\")."
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:138
msgid "Loading Behavior"
msgstr ""

#: plus/inc/theme-options/sections/custom_css.php:139
msgid ""
"\"Block until consent\" completely prevents the script from loading until "
"the user agrees. \"Consent-aware\" always loads the script but passes the "
"current consent state to it — only use this for scripts that natively "
"support consent signals."
